    "marks": {
      "7": "Frame 7: the first hit. Hitlag: 4 frames",
      "8": "Frame 8: the stick smashed up. {char} moves 6 units",
      "9": "Frame 9: the stick back to the center",
      "11": "Frame 11: smashed up again, for the next hit"
    },
    "lessons": [
      {
        "title": "SDI",
        "text": [
          "On each frozen frame after the hit's own, the game moves {char} 6 units toward the control stick if it is past 70% of its reach and left the center within the last 4 frames. A stick held still counts once, and one held from before the hit not at all.",
          "Electric hits freeze the victim half as long again: Pikachu's 2-damage down smash freezes {char} 4 frames per hit, 3 of them after the hit's own."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "stick": [
                  0,
                  1
                ],
                "frame": 8,
                "hold": 1
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "7": "Frame 7: the first hit. Hitlag: 4 frames",
              "8": "Frame 8: the stick smashed up. {char} moves 6 units, still frozen",
              "10": "Frame 10: the last frame of hitlag",
              "11": "Frame 11: hitlag ends"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  7,
                  7
                ],
                "words": "The hit: SDI is not read on this frame",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  8,
                  10
                ],
                "words": "Hitlag: smash the stick now",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  11,
                  12
                ],
                "words": "Hitlag over: too late for this hit",
                "kind": "late"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Out of a multi-hit",
        "text": "Pikachu's down smash hits up to 7 times: 6 weak hits hold {char} beside Pikachu, then the 7th launches. Each hit takes new SDI inputs. Smash on every hit, back to the center between, and {char} is out before the 7th. Against this attack up works for every character, out within 4 hits. One smash, or a held stick, moves {char} 6 units and no more.",
